<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>Pi 把信任放在「谁装了它」，而不是「它是什么代码」上</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 480, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>结构做对的</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 14}}>三层接缝按变化轴裁接口<br />统一注入点<br />进程内护栏：失败即拦</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 648, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#A32D2D"}}>没护栏的</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 14}}>没有默认沙箱——扩展 = 宿主进程同等权限<br />装一个陌生包 ≈ 执行它的任意代码<br />也没有 MCP / ACP：外部工具要付适配层税<br />也没有扩展 API 版本契约</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 10}}>不是说它不安全，是说护栏要你自己补。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>36 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
